WEBVTT

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:36.700
I've come to tell you, Kannagi's 
faithful Zokusho, the truth.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:41.280
The one behind the plot to murder 
the princess was Kannagi.

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:46.240
Ohika, become my Zokusho.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:53.420
Okoro

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:49.300
You will accept, will you not?

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:58.760
Lord Akachi, I do not 
believe what you say.

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:04.090
Even if what you say is true,

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:06.970
I have sworn loyalty to Lord Kannagi.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:12.030
I will bear Lord Kannagi's 
crimes with him as his Zokusho.

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:16.850
Master Ohika...

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:23.990
Are you saying you refuse to obey me?

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:26.830
I am sorry.

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:32.790
To think all of you would so 
deeply trust a man like him.

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:45.560
Lord Akachi...

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.480
Appear, Okoro.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.250
Dear...

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.730
Fuyo!

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.240
Mistress...

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.230
What are you doing, Lord Akachi?!

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:06.060
Submit to me, Ohika.

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.470
You intend to become king?

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:10.620
Then, why do you want me?

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:14.630
Curse your own role 
as Kannagi's Zokusho.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.410
It is not just you.

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:21.370
I have already acquired six Hayagami.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.250
I will ask one last time.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:27.570
Will you voluntarily 
submit yourself to me,

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:32.140
or will you watch your wife die first, 
before I force you to submit?

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:37.270
I hear your wife is with child.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.320
That bastard...

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:48.950
<i>You didn't run away, Arata the Sho?</i>

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.760
I understand. I will submit to you.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.890
However, please give me your word

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:11.180
that you will not lay a hand on 
my wife or family, or my guests.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:13.890
Ohika-san...

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:16.860
You have my word.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.140
Dear!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.020
This is right.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:34.250
Hayagami Kaneri, submit now 
to the great Sho before me.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:38.810
My life shall be as one 
with the great Hayagami.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:14.820
Master?

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:15.940
What was that sound?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.560
Please, spare my child.

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:36.520
Ohika...

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.440
<i>What is this monster?</i>

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:48.160
<i>Human life means nothing to him.</i>

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.280
<i>He's...</i>

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.510
<i>...a demon.</i>

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.610
So you're the one?

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:03.290
That is the Hayagami 
Tsutsuga submitted to?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.470
What's wrong? You're cowering.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.590
Akachi!

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:21.190
You're late, Kannagi.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.720
Akachi...

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:25.300
Fuyo!

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:30.320
I refused to believe it until 
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.020
Why did you kill them all?!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:36.600
The battle for the throne 
has begun, Kannagi.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.630
Appear, Homura!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:42.460
Okoro!

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:54.260
Akachi!

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:36.260
Homura!

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.410
Akachi...

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:22.740
Appear!

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:38.410
Wow...

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.300
So this is a battle between 
members of the Twelve Shinsho.

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:44.480
Honi-chan...

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:48.880
Why, Akachi? Why did you do this?!

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:53.630
Akachi!

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.640
Akachi!

00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.140
Emisu...

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:04.640
Emisu loved you.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.090
But you...

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.220
Kigisu, Haga,

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:39.180
Uka, Kuroji, Sasage,

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:40.760
Ohika...

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:44.560
That's right. They're your Zokusho.

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:48.350
Now they give their 
power to my Hayagami.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:51.320
This battle is over, Kannagi.

00:09:51.930 --> 00:09:54.280
I will take your Hayagami, as well.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.970
Kannagi's Hayagami...

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:04.290
Akachi...

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.250
Damn you!

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:30.940
Aw, man!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:42.410
Why, Akachi?!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:49.870
It was you who betrayed 
us first, Kannagi.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.030
Now you will feel the pain of loss.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:56.130
The agony will remain 
with you forever,

00:10:56.860 --> 00:11:00.200
along with the sin carved 
into your right shoulder.

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:11.660
I won't kill you.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:14.900
Not until I hear the words 
straight from your lips.

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:17.820
Now, submit to me.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:19.990
Terrible...

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:22.600
<i>He betrayed the princess,</i>

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:26.890
<i>then he framed another for his 
crime so he could become king.</i>

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:36.780
Stop!

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:40.740
You're fighting an unarmed man!

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:41.690
Master Arata!

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:42.970
Don't do it, Arata!

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:46.930
Do you desire the throne, as well?

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:51.150
You destroyed the lives of people 
who were living in peace.

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:54.690
You killed innocent people.

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:59.400
And even... And even a life 
that wasn't born yet.

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:01.890
What does it mean to be king?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:05.880
There's no meaning in 
obtaining a title like that!

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:11.510
No meaning, you say?

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:16.040
Stop flaunting that idealistic 
sense of justice, boy.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.970
If you are a Sho, remember this.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:22.760
From now on, it's either 
submit or be submitted to.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.260
I will grant you a reprieve.

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:28.820
Continue to suffer in your agony.

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:34.820
Wait!

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:55.470
Lord Kannagi, bring 
my master back to me.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:12:59.750
You're strong, aren't you?

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.330
You can bring him back, right?

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:03.380
You can save Master Ohika, right?

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.340
My master respected you.

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:10.580
He always said you were a great Sho.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:13.010
He said no other Sho 
could compare to you.

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.600
So you can do it, right?

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.170
I cannot.

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:23.020
Once a Sho has been submitted and 
absorbed by another's Hayagami,

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:26.030
he can never return.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.220
He will never come back!

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:33.190
Besides, I no longer have my Hayagami.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:43.430
The master and mistress were so 
happy to have their first child.

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:47.240
They told me I would help 
look after the baby.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:51.430
They asked me to care for him 
like he was my own family.

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:55.640
They laughed... We all laughed...

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.070
I'm sorry.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.710
Why?!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.290
Wait!

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:11.850
You're depressed?

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:14.950
Is it because Akachi took your Hayagami?

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:19.270
Or is it because Ohika-san and 
the other Zokusho were forced to submit?

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.420
You knew, didn't you?

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:24.130
You knew this would happen, right?

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:28.160
You killed the princess!

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.330
You must have known that,

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:33.360
with her gone, the Sho would 
start a submission war!

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:35.020
And this is the result!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:37.880
Ohika-san was a good man.

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:40.780
He trusted me, even though 
we had only just met.

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:42.980
He even tried to protect me.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:46.300
He even believed in you until the end!

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:50.780
You betrayed all the Zokusho 
who believed in you!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.200
So why are you the one 
getting depressed?!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.380
Don't be ridiculous!

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.750
What do you know?!

00:14:57.240 --> 00:15:00.380
We were under the princess's 
control all that time.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.960
I couldn't let that 
opportunity pass me by!

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:06.460
I wanted...

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.300
...to set Homura free.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:17.220
Wait, Lord Kannagi!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.050
It's no use. He's no longer...

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:22.250
You're the one Tsutsuga submitted to!

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.950
He was taken in by your 
Hayagami, wasn't he?

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:27.900
You're just like Akachi!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.530
I hate Sho.

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:36.890
Hey, where are you going?

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:38.240
Are you going after Akachi?

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:40.310
Are you gonna do the submission war thing?

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:41.340
No.

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:42.840
Then, where are you going?

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:46.300
The princess told you to 
lead the nation, right?

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.420
Doesn't that mean you're to become king?

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:51.300
I told you, I won't become king!

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:13.500
Yo!

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.360
Hey!

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:19.940
What're you so surprised for?

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:21.660
Well, where'd you come from?

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.330
Forget that. Are you...

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:28.880
Oh, uh... I mean, you've been out 
of school for a long time, so...

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:32.090
Who are you?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.160
Huh?

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.570
Oh, yeah. You're right.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:39.930
I'm not your friend anymore, am I?

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.860
Thanks for this.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:44.380
What is it?

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.440
What's with him?

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:03.080
<i>I want you to lead 
Amawakuni in my place.</i>

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:07.010
Was the princess really 
telling me to become king?

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:10.040
To do what Akachi is doing?

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.380
The moon is beautiful again tonight.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.060
I can't forgive him.

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:21.980
I can't forgive Akachi.

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:25.010
But, if I'm to stop him...

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:37.600
It's natural to be scared.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:40.240
Even I would be, against him.

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.900
I can't see Lord Akachi's heart.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:48.030
It's as if he has no soul.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:49.810
No. That's not it.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:55.380
I am scared, but even more so...

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:59.600
I'm angry with myself 
because I couldn't do anything.

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:04.310
Because I'm weak, 
because I don't have enough power...

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.390
I want to get stronger.

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.010
I want to get stronger 
and make Akachi...

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:12.330
But that would make 
me the same as Akachi.

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:15.820
The strong make the weak 
submit to them by force.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.650
It still ends in us killing each other!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.460
You're thinking too much.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:25.950
Kanate...

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:29.330
You've never fought for real, have you?

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:31.340
I have.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:33.300
Kanate!

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:36.180
Then bring it on! You're mad, right?

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.630
Come on! Bring it!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:41.940
I don't want to hurt anyone.

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:46.000
Pathetic! Then just do nothing!

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.310
Pretend you didn't see 
anything and run away!

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.230
<i>I won't acknowledge you.</i>

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:55.990
If you want to get stronger,

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:57.490
if you want to get the things you want,

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:59.280
you have to get hurt, and hurt others!

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:02.020
You can't lead this nation!

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:04.150
Just give up right now!

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.240
I don't want to run anymore!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.760
The princess trusted me.

00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:14.050
I have to get stronger 
to live up to that trust.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:15.500
I have to fight.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:19.280
If the Twelve Shinsho fight 
using their Kamui,

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:21.610
the nation will suffer terribly.

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:27.420
I want to stop it, without 
submitting myself or anyone else!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.750
But that's...

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:32.850
That's right.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:37.030
Warden Tsutsuga didn't submit 
to you because he lost.

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:41.370
You didn't take his life.

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.620
Maybe he entrusted it to you!

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:45.580
Entrusted?

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:50.240
<i>I believe you have what it takes 
to wield Saniwa with justice.</i>

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:54.640
Entrusted...

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:00.990
Now I remember

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:04.500
something Mistress Makari 
told me when I was young.

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.110
She said there is a legendary Hayagami

00:20:07.110 --> 00:20:09.000
that possesses no fighting Kamui,

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:12.940
a sword of origins that 
will reign over the world.

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:19.370
Master Arata, your Hayagami may 
be the legendary Hayagami,

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:21.240
Tsukuyo.

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:26.790
A sword of origins,

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:29.750
one that doesn't fight, 
but will reign over the world.

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:32.580
Tsukuyo?

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.330
This light...

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:59.570
Is that so?

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:02.020
Is that so?

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:11.540
Save him? You mean it?!

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.050
There's no guarantee,

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:16.860
but it might be possible 
to take back a life

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:18.380
that had been absorbed by a Hayagami.

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:20.600
With great power...

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:24.150
The princess might be able to bring

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:27.090
Ohika-san back from Akachi's Hayagami.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:29.740
Bring him back...

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:32.730
I could see the master again.

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:38.500
Lead this nation...

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:41.480
I think I understand 
what that means now.

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:44.910
Master Arata...

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:51.540
<i>To make sure no one else has to suffer,</i>

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:53.410
<i>I will move forward.</i>

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:05.770
Hinohara...

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:08.880
Hey!

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:43.440
I am just a normal girl.

00:23:43.440 --> 00:23:45.370
I thought you had shut 
yourself up at home,

00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:48.050
and now you're faking amnesia?

00:23:48.050 --> 00:23:50.380
Why did Tsukuyo choose someone like you?

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:51.700
I promised

00:23:51.090 --> 00:23:54.870
Homura

00:23:52.230 --> 00:23:54.870
that I would protect you!
